# ============================================================
# Course Policy Compliance
# DATA 100 课程禁止公开分享作业解答。
# 以下模式排除已完成的作业/实验/项目笔记本文件。
# 原始空白模板可在官方仓库查看：
# https://github.com/DS-100/sp25-student
# ============================================================
hw/*/hw*.ipynb
lab/*/lab*.ipynb
proj/*/proj*.ipynb
grad-proj/*/*.ipynb
disc/*/disc*_solutions.ipynb

